{"Missing cache invalidation when organization is enabled/disabled - When an organization is enabled or disabled, the login caches are not invalidated. IDPs linked to an organization have their isEnabled() method overridden to return false if the organization is disabled, but the login cache doesn't know about this change. This causes stale cache data where disabled organization's public IDPs might still appear in cached login IDP list, or enabled organization's public IDPs might not appear until cache expires.": 0.8230277299880981}